desc
@Program that tests wcspih(), the WCS FITS parser for image headers, by
reading a test header and using pgsbox() to plot coordinate graticules for
the resulting wcsprm structs.
@


8.10
log
@WCSLIB 8.10
@
text
@/*============================================================================
  WCSLIB 8.10 - an implementation of the FITS WCS standard.
  Copyright (C) 1995-2026, Mark Calabretta

  This file is part of WCSLIB.

  WCSLIB is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify it under the
